    "detailed_description": "Alva follows a mysterious girl named Elma, who may be an end to their despair.<br>Elma latches onto Alva, who holds the key to her release.<br>Together, they try to escape the labyrinth lying under the pretense of a circus.<br>Together, they try to find a way to be freed.  <br><br><strong>\u2662\u2662\u2662\u2662\u2662</strong><br><br>A horror exploration game that takes place in an underground labyrinth.<br>Navigate your way through various traps and mazes. <br>Dodge malicious creations that are perpetually hungry.    <br>Depart from the nightmares that constantly haunt you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2142470/extras/38588a3617d9d8a256e093c41e47fac4.avif?t=1663808073\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Advance through different levels of the labyrinth.<br></li><li> Uncover stories and converse with others to survive.<br></li><li> Solve puzzles by finding bits of what's past.<br></li><li> Find another puzzle within a puzzle.<br></li><li> Try and stop the memories that torment you.  <br></li><li> <strong>Avoid those who are eager to consume your soul.</strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Arrow keys \u2014 Movement<br></li><li> Enter or Space bar \u2014 Interact<br></li><li> Save \u2014 Interact with Rabbit Dolls<br></li><li> X or Escape \u2014 Check Inventory<br></li><li> W or F12 \u2014 Return to Title screen<br></li><li> F5 \u2014 Toggle Fullscreen/Window modes<br></li><li> F1 \u2014 View/Change display settings<br><br><i>To use Steam Overlay, please change the screenshot key settings <br>to another key other than F12, F5, or F1.</i></li></ul>",
